e_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1486804-blood-magic-at-this-point-is-extremely-common?p=1487099#post1487099\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Setite beer gives the same effect plus alcohol and a different taste from blood.<br /> <br /> Orgasming over something doesn't change that the experience gets repetitive, and in their case <b><u><i>extremely</i></u></b> repetitive, even if always orgasmic.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know about that. <br /> The hunt itself can be fun, and if boring, you can change your style. <br /> I don't know if people will taste very different from one another, and I think resonances are mostly-stupid, but vampires can enjoy the effects of drugs through the blood, and there is exotic blood out there if you don't mind a little risk. <br /> <br /> In any case, Heroin users don't get bored of heroin, and vampires don't build up a tolerance to blood like heroin users do with heroin. <br /> <br /> (also, I don't care for beer. Perhaps when the FoS manage to make blood diabetically sweet and carbonated I'll be impressed) <br /> (also, I reckon the Tremere probably have the beer ritual somewhere, they just don't spread it internally, because they find some aspects &quot;magic beer&quot; problematic)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join 